    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p31-q93-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Prove that $\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\dfrac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}=2\\cot\\theta$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p31-q93-a-short-result",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The identity holds where ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\sin\\theta\\ne0",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p31-q93-a-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Combine the fractions, use ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\sin^2\\theta=1-\\cos^2\\theta",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", and cancel ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "1-\\cos\\theta",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " to obtain ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "2\\cot\\theta",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "The original expression requires $\\sin\\theta\\ne0$ and $1-\\cos\\theta\\ne0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta-(1-\\cos\\theta)^2}{(1-\\cos\\theta)\\sin\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{1-\\cos^2\\theta-(1-2\\cos\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta)}{(1-\\cos\\theta)\\sin\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{2\\cos\\theta(1-\\cos\\theta)}{(1-\\cos\\theta)\\sin\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}&=\\frac{2\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}\\\\\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}&=2\\cot\\theta.\\end{align*}$$\nThe cancelled factor is nonzero on the original domain.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 64
      },
      {
        "id": "p31-q93-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p31-q93-b-instruction",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "left",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 2,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Hence, solve for ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "0\\le\\theta\\le2\\pi",
                  "display": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ":",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p31-q93-b-equation",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "center",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 2,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}=0",
                  "display": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p31-q93-b-short-result",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\theta=\\frac\\pi2,\\ \\frac{3\\pi}{2}",
                    "display": false
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p31-q93-b-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Use ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\cot\\theta=\\frac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and check both values in the original expression.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "From part (a),\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\cot\\theta&=0\\\\\\frac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}&=0\\\\\\cos\\theta&=0\\\\\\theta&=\\frac\\pi2,\\ \\frac{3\\pi}{2}.\\end{align*}$$\nBoth candidates have $\\sin\\theta\\ne0$ and $1-\\cos\\theta=1$. Checking the original left-hand side:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\left.\\left(\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}\\right)\\right|_{\\theta=\\pi/2}&=1-1=0\\\\\\left.\\left(\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}-\\frac{1-\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}\\right)\\right|_{\\theta=3\\pi/2}&=-1-(-1)=0.\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $\\theta=\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}{2}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 80
      }
    ]
